 odprodat za symbolickou cenu\n– Wi-Fi router \n\n\nZastávka autobusu je před domem, 8 minut na metro Strašnická, 15 minut na metro Pankrác. Vynikající spojení na D1.\n\nV bytě lze zprovoznit zdarma internet.\n\nProhlídka je možná 8.11.2026 nebo 10.11.2026 v 18:00.\n\nProsím realitní kanceláře, aby mě nekontaktovaly.","detail_done":true,"disp":"1+kk","district":10,"first_seen":"2026-10-27","floor":2,"floors_total":10,"furnished":"partly","garage":true,"heating":"central","history":[["2026-10-27",14990]],"id":"bezrealitky-848936","images":["https://api.bezrealitky.cz/media/cache/record_main/data/images/advert/848k/848936/1719565308-zsjvpbgwqa-slatinka2.jpg","https://api.bezrealitky.cz/media/cache/record_main/data/images/advert/848k/848936/1719566754-zbbtiatqri-v-korytech.jpg","https://api.bezrealitky.cz/media/cache/record_main/data/images/advert/848k/848936/1753709813-ipprfatxbi-pl-c3-a1nek-c-48.jpg","https://api.bezrealitky.cz/media/cache/record_main/data/images/advert/848k/848936/1753710194-xsfopxqcsf-legenda-m-c3-adstnost-c3-ad.jpg","https://api.bezrealitky.cz/media/cache/record_main/data/images/advert/848k/848936/1719565402-hxtziqdrvs-20160206-073157.jpg","https://api.bezrealitky.cz/media/cache/record_main/data/images/advert/848k/848936/1753709688-okabhudjdm-img-5983.jpg","https://api.bezrealitky.cz/media/cache/record_main/data/images/advert/848k/848936/1753709688-rwtbfzmgzh-img-5982.jpg","https://api.bezrealitky.cz/media/cache/record_main/data/images/advert/848k/848936/1719565334-hsedeykpyv-img-2222.jpg","https://api.bezrealitky.cz/media/cache/record_main/data/images/advert/848k/848936/1753709687-tswtddnffj-img-5979.jpg","https://api.bezrealitky.cz/media/cache/record_main/data/images/advert/848k/848936/1753709688-yupvwxeuhk-img-5981.jpg","https://api.bezrealitky.cz/media/cache/record_main/data/images/advert/848k/848936/1753710046-xfepjohmep-photo-3-2025-07-22-17-23-34.jpg"],"last_seen":"2026-10-27","lat":50.05583595,"lift":true,"loggia":null,"lon":14.49290808263